  "description": "Hwa-Seon, who desperately sought to overcome his severe appearance complex by saving up money, visits a plastic surgery clinic. Driven to despair by the annoying low-balance alarm, he visits a loan shark, his last hope. There, he meets a handsome, angelic-looking man named Shi-Gyeon.\n\n *\"Even if I have to go, I have to lend him money at least once.\"*\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
